  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "GeoNW: add support for 5 ETSI Release 2 PSIDs",
  "description": "Adds dissection of secured frames carrying 5 ETSI Release 2 ITS-AIDs from TS 102 965 v2.4.1 Annex A:\n\n  AVM  (71)   — TS 103 882\n  VAM  (638)  — TS 103 300-3\n  IMZM (640)  — TS 103 724\n  MR   (1618) — TS 103 759\n  POI  (1619) — TS 103 916\n\nEach PSID gets an enum constant, a value-string entry and a sub-dissector table registration so the inner ETSI ITS PDU",
